<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge edges up to 75.7999 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge edges up to 75.7999 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7999 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.8000 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 20		  May 19</p>
<p> High			     75.8000		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				75.7700		 75.5000</p>
<p> Open			     75.7999		 75.5000</p>
<p> Close			    75.7999		 75.8000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  1.620		   4.400</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
